Source: sysible-release
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Sysible <maintainers@sysible.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://sysible.com
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: sysible-release
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates, gnupg, curl
Description: Sysible Linux apt configuration and archive keyring
 Configures apt for Sysible Linux: the Sysible archive keyring and repository,
 plus the upstream vendor repositories (Docker CE, Kubernetes, Helm, HashiCorp,
 OpenTofu, VS Code, Google Cloud CLI) that back the tools sysible-workstation
 recommends but Debian does not ship. Vendor keyrings are installed by the bundled
 fetch script during the ISO build.
